%% ID: S07 | Title: HandoffConfirmModal 兩選一 | Last updated 2026-05-25
%% User action：BU 在 emit_dual_output 後彈出的 HandoffConfirmModal 點選項
%% 兩個選項：
%%   1. 進入 Consult mode → confirm_handoff → consult subgraph 走 load_template + auto_fill_outline
%%   2. 再討論一下 → dismiss_handoff → 清 ready_to_handoff，回 Explore 對話
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BU
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(HandoffConfirmModal + page.tsx)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SVC as session_service.py
    participant G as Graph
    participant LLM
    participant Bus as SSE Bus

    Note over BU,FE: 前置：emit_dual_output 已 publish handoff_ready<br/>FE setHandoff{paragraph}<br/>BU 看到 200-400 字段落描述

    alt 選項 1：進入 Consult mode
        BU->>FE: 點「進入 Consult mode」
        FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/handoff/confirm
        API->>SVC: confirm_handoff（session_service.py:157）
        SVC->>G: aupdate_state {mode: 'consult_step1'}
        SVC->>Bus: publish mode_changed {from:'explore', to:'consult_step1'}
        Bus-->>FE: SSE mode_changed → refetch session
        SVC->>G: ainvoke{}

        Note over G: Consult subgraph entry（subgraph.py:42）<br/>brd_outline 空 → load_template
        G->>G: load_template_node（consult/nodes.py:127）<br/>讀 templates/brd/{bu}_{"type"}.yaml<br/>fallback default.yaml
        G->>G: auto_fill_outline（consult/nodes.py:167）<br/>同 super-step 連到
        G->>LLM: auto_fill_outline.j2 chat_structured<br/>SectionDraftListOutput
        LLM-->>G: 章節 drafts
        G->>Bus: publish outline_ready {sections}
        Bus-->>FE: SSE outline_ready → setLiveSections + 渲染大綱樹

        G->>G: 設 mode='consult_step2' + current_section_idx<br/>→ 同 super-step 連到 section_loop
        G->>LLM: section_question.j2 chat_stream
        loop streaming
            LLM-->>G: chunk → publish agent_reply_delta {section_id}
            Bus-->>FE: SSE agent_reply_delta
        end
        G->>Bus: publish agent_reply_done {section_id}
        Bus-->>FE: SSE agent_reply_done<br/>進 Consult Step 2

        SVC-->>API: state
        API-->>FE: 202 AcceptedResponse
        FE->>FE: setHandoffnull<br/>UI 換版面為 ConsultFullscreenLayout

    else 選項 2：再討論一下
        BU->>FE: 點「再討論一下」
        FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/handoff/dismiss
        API->>SVC: dismiss_handoff（session_service.py:194）
        SVC->>G: aupdate_state {ready_to_handoff: False}
        SVC-->>API: state
        API-->>FE: 202 AcceptedResponse
        FE->>FE: setHandoffnull<br/>留在 Explore，BU 可繼續對話 / 重選候選
    end
